OL,3,GNEWSAProposed budget 'a step in the
OL,4,Aright direction'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey's government has released its
OL,7,Fbudget for 2027 to 2030, with a number
OL,8,Fof targeted measures designed to help
OL,9,Ffamilies with the cost of living.
OL,11,FThese include increasing the number of
OL,12,Ffree hours of nursery care for two to
OL,13,Fthree-year-olds from 15 hours to 20
OL,14,Fhours, and doubling the parental grant
OL,15,Fto #1,800 for families with newborns or
OL,16,Fthose adopting a child.
OL,18,FThe funding for the Health Department
OL,19,Fhas increased again, from #381m in 2026
OL,20,Fto #406m.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
