OL,3,GNEWSAProposed budget 'a step in the
OL,4,Aright direction'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast year, the Fiscal Policy Panel said
OL,7,FJersey was spending more than it was
OL,8,Fearning, but Treasury Minister Alan
OL,9,FMaclean told the BBC the planned new
OL,10,Fbudget was "a step in the right
OL,11,Fdirection" towards correcting that.
